@startuml daemon_startup
hide empty description
title Child daemon startup transaction and retirement
[*] --> EndpointOwned : create private endpoint
EndpointOwned --> ChildOwned : start child specification
ChildOwned --> Observing : acquire output pump and shutdown hook
Observing --> Ready : sentinel + live process within readiness budget
Ready --> Committed : transfer ChildProcessResources
Committed --> Retiring : shutdown / death / owner close
EndpointOwned --> Rollback : acquisition failure
ChildOwned --> Rollback : setup failure
Observing --> Rollback : timeout / invalid readiness
Ready --> Rollback : commit failure
Rollback --> Retiring : attempt all owned cleanup
Retiring --> Closed : every resource terminal
Retiring --> CleanupIncomplete : preserve owners + aggregate failures
CleanupIncomplete --> Retiring : explicit cleanup retry
Closed --> [*]
note right of Committed
  Publish only after commit.
  Retire dead prior owner before replacement.
  Shared ownership mechanics;
  distinct supervisor/profiler authority policies.
end note
@enduml
